#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-use-usb-devices.rst:122
#: 1718b2041656499e8b9739fb67f1cf1d
msgid ""
"Some USB devices are not compatible with the USB pass-through method Qubes "
"employs. In situations like these, you can try to pass through the entire "
"USB controller to a qube as PCI device. However, with this approach you "
"cannot attach single *USB devices* but have to attach the whole *USB "
"controller* with whatever USB devices are connected to it."
msgstr ""

